            0.616,
            0.882,
            0.675
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. The radii of two cylinders are in the ratio 2:3, and their heights are in the ratio 3:2. Find (a) the ratio of their volumes, and (b) the ratio of their curved surface areas."
            }
